  <entity00164779:BasedSharePriceOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementLineItemsOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dTQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_TypesOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementsAxis_entity00164779_One2NdMemberOfStockSettlementBasedShareBasedPaymentArrangementMemberOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfMember" unitRef="KRWEPS" decimals="INF">108500</entity00164779:BasedSharePriceOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfShareBasedPaymentArrangementLineItemsOfDisclosureOfTermsAndConditionsOfSharebasedPaymentArrangementTableOfItems>
